# Syphon Filter 3 (USA)
[PGXP Vertex Precision Fix]
Type = Gameshark
Activation = EndFrame
Author = Stenzek
Description = Keeps full screen-space vertex precision through the game's packed vertex buffers, so PGXP CPU mode works without the vertex cache. Uses RAM 8000C000-8000D80F.
